ical to the accepted predecessor. Truthfully red: in-worktree make regenerate-check exits 2 (underlying git diff --exit-code exits 1) because it diffs against 57c1f56 while the whole rc.5 candidate is uncommitted. Delta vs predecessor still exactly CHANGELOG.md + decision 0007 + the reference; nothing staged, committed, published or pinned; predecessor worktree untouched at 57c1f56 with 127 dirty entries; no rust/swift/kotlin/jdk platform validation claimed.
