15426-+## Probe anomalies and expected-red record
--
15460-- FINDING: a naive "mutate the snapshot during `Inspect`" test does **not** discriminate the bracket — the final all-source recheck catches it anyway and the run still fails clean. The bracket is only observable through *where* the failure lands: with it, planning stops at that command (one inspection, zero planned builds, zero builder calls, error names `build-skill.alpha`); without it, a second command is planned and its miss is compiled first. The test asserts the former.
15461-- FINDING: trust must be finalized even when nothing is compiled. A plan of pure cache hits establishes a session, skips the builder entirely, and previously reached live mutation with no re-verification at all. `TestCacheHitOnlyPlanStillFinalizesToolchainTrust` pins it.
15462-- SCOPE: `internal/install/{builddeps,plan,stage}.go` + `stage_test.go`; comment-only touches in `{install,global}.go`. Five new regressions plus an ordering assertion inside `OnStaged` (verified exactly once, not yet closed).
15463:- EVIDENCE: `gofmt -l`, `go build ./...`, `go vet ./...`, `go test -count=1 ./internal/install/`, `go test -count=1 ./...` (36 packages), scoped `golangci-lint@v2.1.6 run ./internal/install/...`, and `git diff --check` all exit 0. Repo-wide lint still exits 1 on the same 45 pre-existing issues outside `internal/install`. Both fixes were temporarily reverted to confirm the new tests fail without them.
15464-- STATUS: `TASK-260720-3itlly` handed back to review, cycle 2. Still uncommitted in `.temp/TASK-260720-1zntv0/worktree` at base `17804cea`.
15465-
15466-### 0938 — Read-only plan review found trust finalization after mutation
