15468-- FINDING: `Project` and `Global` defer `releasePlan` until function exit, after consumer/context/runtime/shim/adapter mutations. `BuildSession.Close` re-fingerprints the trusted toolchain, so a toolchain drift error is currently converted to a failed result only after live state changed. The existing release-failure test checks the status/error but not preservation of prior state.
