Verdict: changes requested. The task is routed to `analysis`, with evidence attached as `TASK-260729-1bf72u_review-verdict.md`.

The Windows cleanup command is invalid as written: after setting `TEMP=$RunTmp`, it treats `TEMP` as the run directory’s parent. A read-only Windows evaluation confirmed `guard_passes=false`, so cleanup always refuses before removal.

Other sampled claims were supported, including 483 passed/17 skipped, strict mypy over 55 files, missing Windows prerequisites, and the official Go 1.25.12 MSI/ZIP hashes from [go.dev](https://go.dev/dl/?mode=json). No installation or repository/system modification was performed.
